{"id":938769,"title":"课程介绍｜推荐系统已死？生成式推荐技术革命已来临！","content":"推荐系统正面临从传统深度学习模型向生成式推荐转变的关键时期。传统模型效果增长困难，成本增加，而生成式AI如ChatGPT的兴起为推荐系统带来新的机遇。本课程旨在探讨生成式推荐是否为工业未来及其与传统系统的区别，并解决大模型在推荐系统中的应用问题及在线延迟成本平衡。课程内容包括观念重塑、基础算法原理、工业实践路线对比等，覆盖SASRec、Bert4Rec等经典算法以及语言模型和语义ID流派。通过解析Meta的HSTU、快手的OneRec及讲师团队提出的OnePiece技术路线，深入探讨各方案优劣及适用场景。此外，还将讨论如何重构现有系统和技术思维以适应新范式，并提供基于不同业务特点设计适合的技术发展路线图的方法。最终目标是弥合传统推荐与生成式推荐之间的鸿沟，帮助从业者理解趋势并有效落地前沿技术。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404915,"user_name":"Geek_5b1ccc","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2861450,"ip_address":"新加坡","ucode":"D3C630DF10764E","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769260075,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147375,"content":"更新时间是平台这边安排的，建议可以咨询一下平台客服哈。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4424762,"ctime":1769322868,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":404915,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"可以一次多更新一些吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4424762,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/84/3a/3d745603.jpg","nickname":"傅聪Cong","note":"","ucode":"83729C2BAD5684","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":677435,"discussion_content":"更新时间是平台这边安排的，建议可以咨询一下平台客服哈。","content_length":81,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1769322869,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":404889,"user_name":"errocks","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1139982,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"D59C3B21B81173","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/65/0e/6dee8123.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime